# PDFs are intentionally not ignored because this repository stores
# final reading assets and reference PDFs as versioned knowledge artifacts.

# Frontiers BFS policy: track PDFs as reading assets; ignore new non-PDF
# source, metadata, extraction, and TeX work files by default.
self-cultivation/前沿BFS/**
!self-cultivation/前沿BFS/**/
!self-cultivation/前沿BFS/**/*.pdf
!self-cultivation/前沿BFS/**/*.PDF
